      "side": 1,
      "message": "The early return skips the macroblock `x` completely, which seems bad.\n\nAn alternative is to still go through the original code, and then add the bias. Do you think that will also work?",
      "revId": "8a6ad1a31b4baf101fa51da229e5786eaded4661",
