      "lineNbr": 823,
      "author": {
        "id": 9545
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-12T00:54:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The following patch illustrates the alternative I mentioned. The original `adjust_rdcost()` function is renamed `adjust_rdcost_unbiased()`. The new `adjust_rdcost()` function first calls `adjust_rdcost_unbiased()`, and then applies a bias for tune\u003diq/ssimulacra2 and is_inter_pred\u003dtrue.\n\n```\ndiff --git a/av1/encoder/rdopt.c b/av1/encoder/rdopt.c\nindex dde46f697f..526593ec40 100644\n--- a/av1/encoder/rdopt.c\n+++ b/av1/encoder/rdopt.c\n@@ -783,8 +783,8 @@ static void get_variance_stats(const MACROBLOCK *x, int64_t *src_var,\n   *src_var \u003c\u003c\u003d 4;\n }\n \n-static void adjust_rdcost(const AV1_COMP *cpi, const MACROBLOCK *x,\n-                          RD_STATS *rd_cost) {\n+static void adjust_rdcost_unbiased(const AV1_COMP *cpi, const MACROBLOCK *x,\n+                                   RD_STATS *rd_cost) {\n   if (cpi-\u003eoxcf.algo_cfg.sharpness !\u003d 3) return;\n \n   if (frame_is_kf_gf_arf(cpi)) return;\n@@ -806,6 +806,17 @@ static void adjust_rdcost(const AV1_COMP *cpi, const MACROBLOCK *x,\n   rd_cost-\u003erdcost \u003d RDCOST(x-\u003erdmult, rd_cost-\u003erate, rd_cost-\u003edist);\n }\n \n+static void adjust_rdcost(const AV1_COMP *cpi, const MACROBLOCK *x,\n+                          RD_STATS *rd_cost, bool is_inter_pred) {\n+  adjust_rdcost_unbiased(cpi, x, rd_cost);\n+  if ((cpi-\u003eoxcf.tune_cfg.tuning \u003d\u003d AOM_TUNE_IQ ||\n+       cpi-\u003eoxcf.tune_cfg.tuning \u003d\u003d AOM_TUNE_SSIMULACRA2) \u0026\u0026\n+      is_inter_pred) {\n+    rd_cost-\u003edist +\u003d rd_cost-\u003edist \u003e\u003e 3;\n+    rd_cost-\u003erdcost +\u003d rd_cost-\u003erdcost \u003e\u003e 3;\n+  }\n+}\n+\n static void adjust_cost(const AV1_COMP *cpi, const MACROBLOCK *x,\n                         int64_t *rd_cost) {\n   if (cpi-\u003eoxcf.algo_cfg.sharpness !\u003d 3) return;\n```",
      "parentUuid": "fbdfa039_4680d415",
      "revId": "8a6ad1a31b4baf101fa51da229e5786eaded4661",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
