        "id": 3678645
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-12T18:55:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, another part of the code has this pattern in place:\n\n```\n    if (intra_rd_y \u003c INT64_MAX) {\n      adjust_cost(cpi, x, \u0026intra_rd_y, /*is_inter_pred\u003d*/false);\n    }\n```\n\nSo we can just use this pattern with `this_yrd`. I think the original author just forgot to add this particular check.",
      "parentUuid": "cbfcafe4_11c3ff5e",
      "revId": "8a6ad1a31b4baf101fa51da229e5786eaded4661",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
